<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective November 21.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     20.80     20.73	  5.90-11.39 5.94-11.44</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     20.80     20.73	  5.71-10.87 5.75-10.92</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     24.00     25.59	 13.61	12.49</p>
<p> White sugar	  24.00     25.59	  8.71	 7.92</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.24	0.26	  0.40	 0.39</p>
</text>
